  "body": "Clients which want to show a simple error state for upload/message sending failed are stuck trying to aggregate the two on their own. Instead, the protocol could somehow support sending the media alongside the message, possibly as a template with attachment. Then, if any part of the upload/send fails, the client simply retries.\n\nA challenge would be encryption, as the server won't have information to put into a template of sorts.",
